# Baby Feed server
#
# The database, the setup secret and the backups live in ~/baby-feed-data,
# deliberately outside this repo — but ignore them here too in case anyone ever
# points BABYFEED_DATA_DIR at the checkout.
server/node_modules/
# Baby Feed's own Caddy build (46 MB, has the DuckDNS module the Homebrew one
# lacks). Fetched by scripts/fetch-caddy.sh rather than committed.
server/bin/caddy
